# Intelligent Interactive UI & Reactive Micro-Apps

This skill brings **GPT-6 Astra "Intelligent UI"** capabilities to Claude Code and Google Antigravity. Rather than answering complex prompts with static text or ASCII tables, this skill generates fully functional, client-side reactive HTML5 micro-apps that open in the user's browser.

---

## 🚀 When to Activate

* **Interactive Calculators:** ROI models, pricing tier calculators, loan/amortization estimators, token quota calculators, or system sizing.
* **Filterable Dashboards:** Live search tables, category filters, metric cards, and data sorting.
* **Interactive Forms & Generators:** Prompt builders, regex testers, configuration builders, and visual parameter tuners.
* **Comparison & Selection Tools:** Side-by-side feature comparison matrices with interactive toggles.

---

## 🛠️ Architecture: Zero-Build Reactive Micro-Apps

Every interactive widget must be **completely self-contained in a single `.html` file** with zero build tools (`npm`, `webpack`, `vite`) required:

1. **Reactive State Engine:** **Alpine.js** (`x-data`, `x-model`, `x-text`, `x-show`, `x-for`) loaded via CDN or local fallback.
2. **Tactile Styling:** **Tailwind CSS v4** styling following `human-crafted-web-design` standards (stacked dark surfaces `#09090b`/`#121215`, 1px `border-neutral-800`, Geist/Inter typography).
3. **Reactive Math & Sliders:** Immediate updates on user input (`@input`, `@change`) with instant reactive recalculation.
4. **Data Export:** Built-in client-side export functions (Export to CSV, Export to JSON, Print/PDF).
5. **Auto-Launch:** Automatically saved to disk and opened via `xdg-open` or `open` for instant interaction.

---

## 📋 Standard Reactive Widget Blueprint

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="dark">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Interactive Tool</title>
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/alpinejs@3.x.x/dist/cdn.min.js" defer></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#09090b] text-neutral-200 min-h-screen p-8" x-data="calculatorState()">
  <!-- Main Reactive Container -->
</body>
</html>
```

---

## 🛡️ Output Token Economy Protocol

* **Never Dump 300+ Lines of HTML into Chat:** Write the HTML widget directly to a project path or `/tmp/interactive-widget.html` using `write_to_file`.
* **Present with Clickable Link:** Provide a single clickable `file://` link and a 1-sentence summary of the interactive capabilities.

## Windows 10/11 & Cross-Platform CLI Interop (`windows-linux-cross-os-runtime-bridge`)
- **Cross-OS Deployment (`install.ps1` & `install.sh`):** All CLI tools (`agy-cheatsheet` / `cs`, `repo-auto-sync`, `skill-evolve`, `skills-audit-update`, `adaptive-model-router`) run natively on Windows 10/11 via `.cmd`/PowerShell shims in `$HOME\.local\bin` and use `Path(tempfile.gettempdir())` instead of hardcoded `/tmp`.
- **Multi-Agent Split Terminal:** On Windows 10/11, use **Windows Terminal (`wt.exe`)** split panes (`wt -p "PowerShell" \; split-pane -V ...`) in place of Linux `tmux`/`kitty`, and `sccache` / MSVC `/MP` for shared build caching across git worktrees.
